## Entity Reference (Matching Your Format)

### **tbl_user** (PK: user_id)
- user_id (PK)
- username (UNIQUE)
- password
- email
- role (ADMIN/STAFF/CLIENT)
- first_name
- last_name
- is_active
- is_archived
- archived_at
- created_at

### **tbl_farmer** (PK: farmer_id)
- farmer_id (PK)
- linked_user_id (FK → tbl_user)
- encoded_by_id (FK → tbl_user)
- first_name
- last_name
- sex
- dob
- civil_status
- mobile_number (UNIQUE)
- rsbsa_reference
- barangay
- sitio
- livelihood_type
- farm_area_ha
- household_size
- is_4ps
- is_pwd
- is_ip
- consent_dpa
- consent_dpa_at
- is_archived
- created_at
- updated_at

### **tbl_farm_parcel** (PK: parcel_id)
- parcel_id (PK)
- farmer_id (FK → tbl_farmer)
- area_ha
- commodity
- land_type
- ownership_type
- is_archived
- created_at

### **tbl_program** (PK: program_id)
- program_id (PK)
- name
- description
- start_date
- end_date
- status (DRAFT/ACTIVE/SUSPENDED/COMPLETED)
- target_barangays
- created_by_id (FK → tbl_user)
- is_archived
- created_at
- updated_at

### **tbl_program_item** (PK: program_item_id)
- program_item_id (PK)
- program_id (FK → tbl_program)
- inventory_item_id (FK → tbl_inventory_item)
- allocated_qty
- unit
- created_at

### **tbl_eligibility_criterion** (PK: criterion_id)
- criterion_id (PK)
- program_id (FK → tbl_program)
- field_name
- operator (EQ/NE/GT/GTE/LT/LTE/IN/IS_TRUE/IS_FALSE)
- value
- created_at

### **tbl_intervention_application** (PK: application_id)
- application_id (PK)
- farmer_id (FK → tbl_farmer)
- program_id (FK → tbl_program)
- status (SUBMITTED/UNDER_REVIEW/APPROVED/REJECTED/CANCELLED/FULFILLED)
- applied_at
- reviewed_at
- approved_by_id (FK → tbl_user)
- rejected_by_id (FK → tbl_user)
- rejection_reason
- cancelled_at
- created_at
- updated_at

### **tbl_inventory_item** (PK: inventory_item_id)
- inventory_item_id (PK)
- name
- description
- unit
- current_qty
- low_stock_threshold
- is_archived
- created_at

### **tbl_stock_batch** (PK: batch_id)
- batch_id (PK)
- inventory_item_id (FK → tbl_inventory_item)
- lot_number (UNIQUE per item)
- quantity_received
- current_qty
- expiry_date (NULL for non-perishable)
- received_date
- received_by_id (FK → tbl_user)
- is_archived
- created_at

### **tbl_stock_movement** (PK: movement_id)
- movement_id (PK)
- inventory_item_id (FK → tbl_inventory_item)
- stock_batch_id (FK → tbl_stock_batch)
- movement_type (RECEIVE/ADJUST/RELEASE)
- qty (signed ±)
- reason
- reference_distribution_id (FK → tbl_distribution)
- recorded_by_id (FK → tbl_user)
- created_at

### **tbl_distribution** (PK: distribution_id)
- distribution_id (PK)
- application_id (FK → tbl_intervention_application) UNIQUE
- inventory_item_id (FK → tbl_inventory_item)
- qty
- status (DRAFT/SCHEDULED/DISPATCHED/IN_TRANSIT/DELIVERED/ARCHIVED)
- scheduled_date
- dispatched_at
- in_transit_at
- delivered_at
- created_by_id (FK → tbl_user)
- confirmed_by_id (FK → tbl_user)
- confirmed_at
- is_archived
- created_at
- updated_at

### **tbl_batch_allocation** (PK: allocation_id)
- allocation_id (PK)
- distribution_id (FK → tbl_distribution)
- stock_batch_id (FK → tbl_stock_batch)
- qty
- created_at

### **tbl_feedback** (PK: feedback_id)
- feedback_id (PK)
- farmer_id (FK → tbl_farmer)
- distribution_id (FK → tbl_distribution)
- rating (1-5)
- comment
- status (NEW/ACKNOWLEDGED/RESOLVED)
- submitted_at
- created_at

### **tbl_announcement** (PK: announcement_id)
- announcement_id (PK)
- title
- content
- target_roles (JSON: ADMIN/STAFF/CLIENT)
- published_at
- created_by_id (FK → tbl_user)
- is_archived
- created_at

### **tbl_activity_log** (PK: log_id)
- log_id (PK)
- user_id (FK → tbl_user)
- log_action
- log_time
- log_description

### **tbl_notification** (PK: notification_id)
- notification_id (PK)
- recipient_id (FK → tbl_user)
- type
- title
- message
- payload (JSON)
- read_at
- created_at
```

---

## Relationship Cardinality Reference

| Relationship | Cardinality | Meaning |
|---|---|---|
| tbl_user → tbl_farmer (encoded_by) | 1:M | One user registers many farmers |
| tbl_user → tbl_farmer (linked_user) | 1:1 | One user owns one farmer profile |
| tbl_farmer → tbl_farm_parcel | 1:M | One farmer has many parcels |
| tbl_farmer → tbl_intervention_application | 1:M | One farmer applies to many programs |
| tbl_program → tbl_program_item | 1:M | One program includes many items |
| tbl_program → tbl_eligibility_criterion | 1:M | One program has many criteria |
| tbl_program_item → tbl_inventory_item | M:1 | Many items allocated to one inventory |
| tbl_inventory_item → tbl_stock_batch | 1:M | One item has many batches |
| tbl_distribution → tbl_batch_allocation | 1:M | One distribution allocates multiple batches (FEFO) |
| tbl_intervention_application → tbl_distribution | 1:1 | One application triggers one distribution |

---

## Critical Constraints

| Table | Constraint | Reason |
|---|---|---|
| tbl_farmer | (linked_user_id, encoded_by_id) | Dual roles: owner + encoder |
| tbl_stock_batch | UNIQUE(inventory_item_id, lot_number) | No duplicate lots per item |
| tbl_intervention_application | Partial UNIQUE(farmer_id, program_id) | Only active apps, allows resubmission after REJECTED |
| tbl_distribution | UNIQUE(application_id) | One distribution per application |
| tbl_batch_allocation | Order by created_at | FEFO allocation order |


